{"t":"Order of the Cobra","s":"order-of-the-cobra-96e00","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Cobra_Scout_30a7bf.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Order of the Cobra</b> is one of the Ancient Orders of King Xenom led by <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarlett%20Etzel\">Scarlett Etzel</a>. It was created after a dispute with her brother <a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Master%20Oberon\">Oberon</a>. The third brother, Kesar Etzel, also founded his own order, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Order%20of%20the%20Lion\">Order of the Lion</a>. Their headquarters are the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Bastion\">Cobra Bastion</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Members_of_the_Order_of_the_Cobra\">Members of the Order of the Cobra</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Regular_Creatures\">Regular Creatures</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Scout\"><img alt=\"Cobra Scout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cobra_Scout_30a7bf.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Scout\">Cobra Scout</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">7,310</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1000 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">500 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\"