ss=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Documents_related_to_the_Order\">Documents related to the Order</span></h2>\n<p>There are several Documents in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Bastion\">Falcon</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Bastion\">Cobra</a> bastions that tell part of the story of the Orders. The collection <i>Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia</i> tells the story about the Ancient Orders of King Xenom:\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia I (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia (part I)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia II (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Piece of Paper (Blank)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Paper_Blank_a2936f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia (part II)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia III (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Parchment (White)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_White_8475ad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Knightly Successor Orders of Tibia (part III)</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The volumes of <i>The Order of the Cobra Compendium</i> summarize the rise and downfall of the Order and its leader, Scarlett Etzel. \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium I (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\"><img alt=\"Parchment (Yellow)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_Yellow_20cba9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium I</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium II (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\"><img alt=\"Parchment (Yellow)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_Yellow_20cba9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium II</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium III (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\"><img alt=\"Parchment (Yellow)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_Yellow_20cba9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium III</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium IV (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\"><img alt=\"Parchment (Yellow)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_Yellow_20cba9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The Order of the Cobra Compendium IV</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Some documents also describe the routine and research of the Cobra Order:\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Chef Luc Venin's Exquisite Cuisine with Poison (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Parchment (White)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_White_8475ad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Chef Luc Venin's Exquisite Cuisine with Poison</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Artefact Ledger of Greig, treasurer of the Order of the Cobra (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Parchment (White)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_White_8475ad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Artefact Ledger of Greig, treasurer of the Order of the Cobra</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dealings%20of%20the%20Knightly%20Orders%20in%20Zao%20%28Book%29\">Dealings of the Knightly Orders in Zao (Book)</a></td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Parchment (White)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_White_8475ad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Dealings of the Knightly Orders in Zao</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure 